      "reasoning": "The AI is considering a mulligan decision. The current hand contains Alley Strangler, Planar Atlas, Ruin in Their Wake, and three Swamps, along with Termination Facilitator. To make a decision, I'll evaluate the hand's potential.\n\
\n\
